# OCS-super-panel — routing.
# Force HTTPS (Cloudflare does this automatically on .pages.dev, but
# explicit for when a custom domain is connected later).

# Treat the bare domain as login if not authenticated.
/        /index.html       200

# Catch-all: route any unknown path back to the login screen so the
# panel never leaks 404 data, never reveals which paths exist.
/*       /index.html       200
